# DATATYPE

## ProposalProducerRef

### Attribute

| name | type | multiplicity | min-length | pattern |
|------+------|--------------|------------|---------|
| value | string | 1 | 1 | (?s).*(?!(?!\x7f)\p{Cntrl})(?!\x20)..* |

## SourceProposalId

### Attribute

| name | type | multiplicity | min-length | pattern |
|------+------|--------------|------------|---------|
| value | string | 1 | 1 | (?s).*(?!(?!\x7f)\p{Cntrl})(?!\x20)..* |

## ProposalSourceKind

### Attribute

| name | type | multiplicity | min-length | pattern |
|------+------|--------------|------------|---------|
| value | string | 1 | 1 | (?s).*(?!(?!\x7f)\p{Cntrl})(?!\x20)..* |

## ProposalJsonText

### Attribute

| name | type | multiplicity | min-length | pattern |
|------+------|--------------|------------|---------|
| value | string | 1 | 2 |  |

## CandidateContent

### Attribute

| name | type | multiplicity | min-length | pattern |
